# rdfs-subclass-closure: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/rdfs-subClassOf.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:Cat rdfs:subClassOf :Mammal. :Mammal rdfs:subClassOf :Animal. :milo a :Cat. :pet rdfs:range :Cat.

# Inference rules
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.

{?C rdfs:subClassOf ?D. ?X a ?C} => {?X a ?D}.
{?C rdfs:subClassOf ?D. ?D rdfs:subClassOf ?E} => {?C rdfs:subClassOf ?E}.
{?C rdfs:subClassOf ?D. ?P rdfs:domain ?C} => {?P rdfs:domain ?D}.
{?C rdfs:subClassOf ?D. ?P rdfs:range ?C} => {?P rdfs:range ?D}.
